          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Xiong Yuan, a sound path Gu Immortal, shouts that the Gu was his and that He Lang Zi snatched it. He Lang Zi walks out of a secret room and sits before him as bidders offer transformation path Immortal Gu and other terms. He Lang Zi finally chooses the first secret room’s offer: grand smoke sea turtle shell Immortal Gu, a large group of water wolves, and verified information on Ascending Heaven Plain. During bidding, Swordmaster You Lan offers moon demon bat claw Immortal Gu. You Lan is Feng Jiu Ge, a sound path Gu Immortal who wants Heavenly Gong for himself.",
        "chapters": [
          751
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
